        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukuna mutshima webe ku nsubu wa mukuenu, kukumi mutshima webe ku mukashi wa mukuenu anyi ku muntu wandi mulume anyi ku muntu wandi mukashi anyi ku ngombe wandi anyi ku mpunda wandi anyi ku tshintu tshionso tshia mukuenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bonso bakatangila makubakuba ne miele ya nvula ne di dia mpungi ne muishi ha mukuna, hakamonabo malu â, bakatshina, bakimana ha bule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakambila Mose ne, Wakula biebe nʼetu, netunvue, kadi biakula Nzambi nʼetu, netufue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wakambila bantu ne, Kanutshinyi, bualu bua Nzambi wakulua bua kunuteta, ditshina diandi dikale ku mpala kuenu, bua nuenu kanuenji malu mabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bakimana kule, ne Mose wakalua hehi ne difutu difike hakadi Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila Mose ne, Wewe wambila Bena Isalele ne, Nuenu nkayenu nuakumona bu munakusomba nʼenu mufume mu diulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuenji nzambi mikuabo bua kuikala hehi nʼanyi nzambi ya tshiamu tshia argent anyi nzambi ya tshiamu tshia or, kanuyenji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.23"
            ]
